/Title (When a process moves between CPUs, some of the cache state it previously used may no longer be local to its new CPU. Cache-coherence traffic and memory access latency can affect performance. The experiment does not directly measure cache misses. Where permissions and hardware support permit, perf stat can collect cpu-migrations and cache-related counters as additional evidence.)
/Dest [11 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 1083 0 R
>>
