/Title (The CA-5 experiment observes how Linux manages worker placement and task distribution. CA-6 can implement simplified task queues, per-core run queues and scheduling decisions in Rust. The Linux measurements provide motivation and comparison points; they do not themselves implement a kernel scheduler.)
/Dest [17 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 1100 0 R
/Prev 1130 0 R
>>
